---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import KofiButton from "../components/KofiButton.astro";
import { LINKS } from "../consts";
---

<Base title="About" description="Who I am and what I'm into.">
  <section class="section prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Safet, a software engineer from Zenica, Bosnia and Herzegovina. I'm doing a master's in Software Engineering at
      the <a href={LINKS.ptf}>Polytechnic Faculty</a> of the <a href={LINKS.unze}>University of Zenica</a>, where I also
      work as a teaching assistant: C#/.NET labs for Object-Oriented Programming Languages in winter, Advanced
      Programming Techniques and Computer Graphics in summer.
    </p>
    <p>
      I like building things all the way down the stack: a resume builder people actually use, Minecraft mods with
      automated release pipelines, render engines written from scratch, and the small CLIs that hold my own workflow
      together.
    </p>

    <h2>What I work on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Products</strong>: <a href="/projects/enginecv/">EngineCV</a>, a local-first resume builder that works
        without an account.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Minecraft mods</strong>: <a href="/projects/throwablemobs/">Throwable Mobs</a> and
        <a href="/projects/adjustability/">Adjustability</a> for Fabric and NeoForge, on
        <a href={LINKS.modrinth}>Modrinth</a> and CurseForge.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Computer graphics</strong>: <a href="/projects/oxide/">Oxide</a> (Rust + WebGPU) and a
        <a href="/projects/terminal-3d/">terminal renderer in C</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Research</strong>: <a href="/publications">multi-agent reinforcement learning</a> and database
        performance.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Algorithms</strong>: <a href="/projects/neetcode/">NeetCode problems</a> in Rust and C++.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Outside the editor</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Lifting.</strong> Training for size; the logbook is as disciplined as the codebase.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Music.</strong> Producing and tinkering with MIDI, which is how <a href="/projects/forgeai/">ForgeAI</a> came
        about.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Minecraft.</strong> I play it, host servers for friends, and then mod what I wish it did, which also
        produced <a href="/projects/world-backup/">world-backup</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={LINKS.email}>safet.imamovic@unze.ba</a>, or find me on <a href={LINKS.github}>GitHub</a> and
      <a href={LINKS.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>. If my mods or tools saved you time:
    </p>
    <KofiButton label="Buy me a coffee" />
  </section>
</Base>
